Vizor (fork for Nyctis)

This product is a modified version of Vizor, a self-custody Zcash wallet
developed by Chainapsis and released under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
Upstream source: https://github.com/chainapsis/vizor-wallet

Modifications by micovi (https://github.com/micovi), 2026: support for Nyctis
assets and channels, as listed in FORK.md. Files changed from upstream can be
identified from this repository's history against the upstream main branch.

